---
import QuickLeadForm from './QuickLeadForm.astro';
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-10 md:pt-16">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute left-[-8rem] top-0 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-jvv-blue/10 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute right-[-6rem] top-24 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-jvv-orange/12 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-full soft-grid opacity-50"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="site-container pb-16 md:pb-24">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr]">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">AI visibility plus technical SEO</div>
        <h1 class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-jvv-dark md:text-6xl">
          Your business may rank in Google and still be invisible in ChatGPT, Perplexity, and AI-generated answers.
        </h1>
        <p class="section-copy max-w-2xl">
          JVV Digital improves technical visibility so search engines and AI systems can understand, surface, and recommend your business where modern buying journeys increasingly begin.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <span class="chip">Technical fixes first</span>
          <span class="chip">AI visibility strategy</span>
          <span class="chip">Website builds when needed</span>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="#quick-review" class="btn-primary">Check My Visibility Setup</a>
          <a href="/services" class="btn-secondary">See services</a>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="surface-strong p-4">
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-jvv-orange">Founder led</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">You work directly with Will, not a layered agency team.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="surface-strong p-4">
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-jvv-orange">Built for today</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">AI search, technical SEO, and site structure all matter.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="surface-strong p-4">
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-jvv-orange">No pricing wall</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Start with a free review, then decide what is actually needed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="quick-review" class="relative">
        <div class="absolute -left-4 -top-4 h-24 w-24 rounded-full bg-jvv-orange/10 blur-2xl"></div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-6 right-0 h-28 w-28 rounded-full bg-jvv-blue/10 blur-2xl"></div>
        <div class="surface-dark relative overflow-hidden p-4 md:p-5">
          <div class="rounded-[1.25rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/10 p-5 md:p-6">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-white/90">
              Start with a free visibility review
            </div>
            <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">Fast review, low friction, practical next steps.</h2>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/80">
              Send your email and website or planned domain. I will review the current setup for technical issues, AI visibility gaps, and the cleanest next move.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-5">
              <QuickLeadForm />
            </div>
            <p class="mt-4 text-xs leading-5 text-white/70">
              If you do not have a live site yet, that is fine. Use your planned domain and I will still point you in the right direction.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
